      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 14,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Only one run is active at a time. A run can be cancelled but not resumed after a restart, and its log\nstays after a refresh.",
